  "Description": {
    "Cost": 4068889,
    "UIName": "Helios",
    "Id": "chassisdef_helios_HEL-6RISC",
    "Name": "Helios",
    "Details": "The HEL-6RISC is completely reskinned with Chameleon LPS-integrated armor shaped to match common Capellan manufactured Helios variants. While the visual deception cannot fool a detailed scan, it is more than enough for the HEL-6RISC and its companions (either support drones or piloted units) to spring a crippling surprise strike. Though hot-running and offensively lackluster, this 'Mech is nonetheless effective in its role as a linchpin for black-ops ambush and raiding teams.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
