  "StockRole": "Skirmisher",
  "YangsThoughts": "Designed to support Assault Mechs such as the Victor and the Emperor, the 60 ton Helios is a St. Ives Compact design that entered production in 3058. Powered by a 300-rated Light Engine and built on an Endo Steel chassis, the Helios HEL-6X is armed with a Heavy PPC. Paired ER Medium Lasers and Medium VSPLs make for a potent combo should anyone try to close range. A C3i computer allows the 6X to function as part of a C3i lance.",
